{"id":"vod_bf_46970","vodId":"46970","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"组长女儿与照料专员","name_cn":"组长女儿与照料专员","date":"2022-01-01","year":"2022","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-48/9a5cd76c97fdfae8d8de57d938d8f145.jpg"},"summary":"雾岛透（细谷佳正 配音）是樱树组的二把手，在他的人生中，解决问题的方式只有一个，那就是通过暴力。因此，雾岛也被人称为“樱树组的恶魔”。某一日，雾岛接受了一个非常特殊的任务——照顾组长的独生女樱树八重花（和多田美咲 配音），很显然，这个任务和雾岛曾经完成的那些任务不同，绝对不可以靠暴力去解决。　　就这样，人见人怕的雾岛成为了八重花的贴身管家。八重花是一个性格十分内向腼腆的女孩，刚开始，她见到凶神恶煞的雾岛感到十分的害怕，但随着时间的推移，雾岛所展现出来的温柔的一面让她对这个男人逐渐产生了依赖。而八重花的存在也让雾岛找到了人生新的意义。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 18:00:35","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241016mI6nkw1Jindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/zuchangnveryuzhaoliaozhuanyuan/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/zuchangnveryuzhaoliaozhuanyuan/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/zuchangnveryuzhaoliaozhuanyuan/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/zuchangnveryuzhaoliaozhuanyuan/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/zuchangnveryuzhaoliaozhuanyuan/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/zuchangnveryuzhaoliaozhuanyuan/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/zuchangnveryuzhaoliaozhuanyuan/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/zuchangnveryuzhaoliaozhuanyuan/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/zuchangnveryuzhaoliaozhuanyuan/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/zuchangnveryuzhaoliaozhuanyuan/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/zuchangnv